## Import

Import an existing vault credential using its composite ID `<vault_id>:<credential_id>`:

```shell
terraform import anthropic_vault_credential.example <vault_id>:<credential_id>
```

After import, write-only secrets are not populated in state. You must either:
- Set `token_wo_version` in your configuration and run `terraform apply` to re-push secrets, or
- Accept that the resource will show no-op plans (secrets stay set server-side but are not tracked in state).
